{"id":85,"title":"പനി പടരുന്നു: സർക്കാർ ആശുപത്രികളിൽ പ്രത്യേക ക്ലിനിക്കുകൾ","subheadline":"ഡെങ്കിപ്പനിക്കും എലിപ്പനിക്കും എതിരെ ജാഗ്രത വേണമെന്ന് ആരോഗ്യ വകുപ്പ്","url":"/health/pani-patarunnu-sarkkar-ashupatrikalil-pratyeka-klinikkukal","full_url":"__PREVIEW_SITE__/health/pani-patarunnu-sarkkar-ashupatrikalil-pratyeka-klinikkukal","image":{"id":145,"alt":"Illustrative stock photo","width":1600,"height":900,"thumbnail":{"url":"__PREVIEW_MEDIA__/images/stock-picsum-45.2e16d0ba.fill-400x225.format-webp.webp","width":400,"height":225},"card":{"url":"__PREVIEW_MEDIA__/images/stock-picsum-45.2e16d0ba.fill-800x450.format-webp.webp","width":800,"height":450}},"primary_category":{"id":12,"name":"Health","slug":"health","colour":"#00838F","url":"/health"},"reporter":{"name":"Anjali Menon","slug":"anjali-menon","url":"/reporter/anjali-menon"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T14:47:39.888157+05:30","last_major_update_at":null,"reading_time":1,"language":"ml","flags":{"is_breaking":false,"is_premium":false,"has_video":false},"hero_image":{"id":145,"alt":"Illustrative stock photo","width":1600,"height":900,"hero":{"url":"__PREVIEW_MEDIA__/images/stock-picsum-45.2e16d0ba.fill-1600x900.format-webp.webp","width":1600,"height":900},"card":{"url":"__PREVIEW_MEDIA__/images/stock-picsum-45.2e16d0ba.fill-800x450.format-webp.webp","width":800,"height":450}},"featured_image_caption":"","featured_image_credit":"Alan Haverty (Picsum #45)","body":[{"type":"paragraph","value":"<p>സംസ്ഥാനത്ത് പനി ബാധിതരുടെ എണ്ണം കൂടുന്ന സാഹചര്യത്തിൽ സർക്കാർ ആശുപത്രികളിൽ പ്രത്യേക പനി ക്ലിനിക്കുകൾ ആരംഭിച്ചു.</p>","id":"a15ee081-f86c-40e6-b51c-78926e86ba13"},{"type":"paragraph","value":"<p>ഡെങ്കിപ്പനി, എലിപ്പനി എന്നിവയ്ക്കെതിരെ ജാഗ്രത പാലിക്കണമെന്ന് ആരോഗ്യ വകുപ്പ് നിർദേശിച്ചു. വീടിന് ചുറ്റും വെള്ളം കെട്ടിനിൽക്കാൻ അനുവദിക്കരുത്.</p>","id":"ede04dba-6ad0-4330-af90-865d134e6bac"},{"type":"paragraph","value":"<p>പനി ലക്ഷണങ്ങൾ കണ്ടാൽ സ്വയം ചികിത്സ ഒഴിവാക്കി അടുത്തുള്ള ആരോഗ്യ കേന്ദ്രത്തിൽ ചികിത്സ തേടണം.</p>","id":"a5d233a4-c611-4a9c-b547-25233ed0f10a"}],"live_updates":[],"corrections":[],"reporter_profile":{"name":"Anjali Menon","slug":"anjali-menon","url":"/reporter/anjali-menon","designation":"Senior Correspondent","beat":"Politics, Thiruvananthapuram","bio":"Anjali covers politics and governance from Thiruvananthapuram. She has reported on the Kerala Assembly for eight years.","photo":null,"social":{"x":null,"facebook":null,"instagram":null,"linkedin":null}},"categories":[{"id":12,"name":"Health","slug":"health","colour":"#00838F","url":"/health"}],"tags":[{"name":"health","slug":"health","url":"/tag/health"}],"location":"","district":"","is_featured":false,"is_editors_pick":true,"is_premium":false,"premium_gate_ready":false,"allow_ads":true,"word_count":36,"updated_at":"2026-11-19T09:32:09.515824+05:30","breadcrumbs":[{"name":"Home","url":"/"},{"name":"Health","url":"/health"},{"name":"പനി പടരുന്നു: സർക്കാർ ആശുപത്രികളിൽ പ്രത്യേക ക്ലിനിക്കുകൾ","url":"/health/pani-patarunnu-sarkkar-ashupatrikalil-pratyeka-klinikkukal"}],"seo":{"title":"പനി പടരുന്നു: സർക്കാർ ആശുപത്രികളിൽ പ്രത്യേക ക്ലിനിക്കുകൾ","description":"ഡെങ്കിപ്പനിക്കും എലിപ്പനിക്കും എതിരെ ജാഗ്രത വേണമെന്ന് ആരോഗ്യ വകുപ്പ്","og_image":"__PREVIEW_MEDIA__/images/stock-_ELAZtXl.2e16d0ba.fill-1200x630.format-jpeg.jpegquality-85.jpg","canonical_url":"__PREVIEW_SITE__/health/pani-patarunnu-sarkkar-ashupatrikalil-pratyeka-klinikkukal","noindex":false,"published_time":"2026-11-17T14:47:39.888157+05:30","modified_time":"2026-11-19T09:32:09.515824+05:30"},"alternate_version":null,"related":[{"id":45,"title":"Statewide health awareness campaign gathers momentum","subheadline":"Volunteers have reached more than two lakh households in the first week","url":"/health/statewide-health-awareness-campaign-gathers-momentum","full_url":"__PREVIEW_SITE__/health/statewide-health-awareness-campaign-gathers-momentum","image":{"id":154,"alt":"Illustrative stock photo","width":1600,"height":900,"thumbnail":{"url":"__PREVIEW_MEDIA__/images/stock-picsum-96.2e16